{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to &quot;Paper Art Gallery,&quot; an artistic puzzle game inspired by the art of paper cutting. Your task is to piece together fragments of paper cutouts to restore the nature-themed artworks in the gallery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----- Game Features ------ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 32 nature-themed paper cut artworks </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive puzzle experience </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Comfortable and relaxing ambient music </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple controls </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Moderately challenging levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----- Game Controls ------ </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hold the left mouse button to move a puzzle piece </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Click the right mouse button to rotate a puzzle piece </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the R key to rotate the held puzzle piece </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Press the ESC key to hide or show the game UI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------------------</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"lv1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652960/5c01a96b2cca149a9e2740ce241e5beab3f626d3.jpg"},{"name":"lv2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652960/cb8a1ccfbd2a9dde1422d458cb723b75cde47c62.jpg"},{"name":"lv3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652960/fd63a5a223fffaaa090df9fc7a237e7f2acbfe57.jpg"},{"name":"lv4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652960/641e7c90c3d930145909b855680734be192fde21.jpg"},{"name":"lv5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3652960/ed580bb3ec59a3c0e03d5b1568c4a5e4945c7aea.jp